update public.courses set title=$t$Forklift Theory Practice (LF)$t$, summary=$t$Learn and practise forklift theory for your LF licence assessment — at your own pace, on any device.$t$, description=$t$Learn and practise the forklift theory you'll be assessed on for your LF High Risk Work Licence: WHS law and standards, hazards, ground conditions and weather, traffic management, pre-start and operational checks, faults and lock out/tag out, stability, load charts, load weight and load centre calculations, attachments, safe operating and stacking, shutdown, refuelling and recharging. Each module ends with a quiz, and a final practice exam helps you check your knowledge. An independent study aid to use alongside your training with an RTO — not nationally recognised training, and it does not give you a licence.$t$, price_cents=4900, currency=$t$aud$t$, published=true where slug='forklift-licence-theory';
